WelcomeOutcome.description:
What ``ensureWelcome`` did with the request.

``DELIVERED`` when this call wrote the onboarding welcome message;
``ALREADY_DELIVERED`` when an earlier call had, and its conversation is returned.

post.description:
End the terminal. Closing a session that has already ended changes nothing.

The host agent still has to stop the shell, which it learns on its next claim;
the session reads CLOSED at once. Requires `runtimes:exec` and a signed-in user.
